{"hymn":"S259","parent":"E317","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Querido Salvador","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Salvos por gracia","syl":{"n1":["Que","i"],"n2":["ri","m"],"n3":["do","t"],"n4":["Sal","i"],"n5":["va","m"],"n6":["dor,","t"],"n7":"Me","n8":["per","i"],"n9":["te","m"],"n10":["ne","m"],"n11":["ces","t"],"n12":"hoy;","n13":"Tu","n14":["nom","i"],"n15":["bre‿he","t"],"n16":"de","n17":["cla","i"],"n18":["mar;","t"],"n19":"Mi","n20":["co","i"],"n21":["ra","m"],"n22":["zón","t"],"n23":"te","n24":"doy.","n26":["¡Mí","i"],"n27":["o,","t"],"n28":"Tú,","n29":["Que","i"],"n30":["ri","m"],"n31":["do","t"],"n32":["Se","i"],"n33":["ñor!","t"],"n35":"Sé","n36":["que‿e","i"],"n37":["res","t"],"n38":["mí","i"],"n40":["o,","t"],"n41":"Mi","n42":"buen","n43":["Sal","i"],"n44":["va","m"],"n45":["dor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Eres amigo fiel","De todo pecador.","Por gracia salvo fui","Al escuchar Tu voz."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Mi duro corazón","Tocaste con Tu‿hablar.","Debido‿a Tu perdón,","Disfruto gozo‿y paz."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Así te‿alabaré;","Hoy mío‿eres Señor;","Yo nunca dudaré,","Pues sé que Tuyo soy."]}]}